#Протокол_Architecture_Graph_Model_V1<[
Базис:
  Текущая вкладка Зависимости задач показывает work.depends_on DAG, но не отвечает на вопрос об архитектуре и проектировании системы.
  Устав и intent tree уже задают устойчивые слои и домены; derived graph viewer и PVRG slice описывают node/edge types, но без отдельной L1/L2 модели оператор не может drill-down внутрь блока.
  Architecture graph должен быть derived projection, rebuildable из charter, intent tree, workgraph.snapshot.v1, trace links и optional memory/evidence exports.
Вектор:
  Зафиксировать architecture graph model v1 с уровнями L1 system blocks, L2 containers/modules и L3 artifacts/files/symbols.
  Явно отделить architecture edges (uses, feeds, validates, implements, defines, maps_to) от operational edge depends_on.
  UX pattern: L1 map -> focus block -> block detail panel with tabs -> optional scoped L2 inner graph; read-only, no manual layout editing.
Цель:
  Единый контракт architecture graph отделяет проектирование системы от очереди задач и готов к architecture.snapshot.v1, UI и PVRG slice reuse.

Проверки:
  описаны L1/L2/L3 уровни
  L1 blocks зафиксированы из устава и intent tree
  edge types отделены от work.depends_on
  описан drill-down pattern без ручного редактора

Метки:
  atom.profile: plan
  protocol.id: architecture-graph-model-v1
  design.input: charter/main.bvc, architecture/main.bvc, intent/index.bvc, workgraph.snapshot.v1, trace-links-v1, pvrg.graph_rag.slice.v1
  design.output: architecture.snapshot.v1
  work.source: design-architecture-graph-model-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#L1_System_Blocks<[
Базис:
  L1 blocks отражают charter layers и intent domains, а не текущую форму UI или исполнителя.
Вектор:
  step-canon: Step Canon — charter, schemas/step-atom-draft, formatter, llm-step-atom-writer protocol.
  work-graph: Work Graph — runtime, backlog, lifecycle, claim/transition, intent/system/runtime and intent/system/storage work.
  project-memory: Project Memory — durable facts, decisions, architecture notes; intent/memory and memory protocols.
  trace-evidence: Trace/Evidence — trace links v1, evidence model, verification loop, step↔code validators.
  agent-runtime: Agent Runtime — worker adapter, local runner, state machine, provider-neutral execution loop.
  domain-onebase: Domain Vertical — OneBase mapping, golden path, posting scenarios, intent/domains/onebase.
  derived-projections: Derived Projections — UI board, architecture map, task dependency graph, dashboard snapshot, PVRG/graph RAG research.
Цель:
  Верхний уровень architecture map показывает столько L1-блоков, сколько задаёт проект в architecture/main.bvc (минимум один), без фиксированного лимита engine.

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  decision.id: architecture-l1-blocks-v1
  protocol.id: architecture-graph-model-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#L2_Containers_And_L3_Artifacts<[
Базис:
  Drill-down внутри блока требует scoped projection, иначе оператор видит весь repo spaghetti graph.
Вектор:
  L2 container node: runtime module, protocol bundle, UI surface, adapter slice or intent subtree root; examples: src/workGraphRuntime.mjs, protocols/agent-worker-adapter.bvc, intent/ui/dashboard.
  L3 artifact/file node: concrete path, symbol, OneBase YAML/.os, test file or memory atom; sourced from target_files, trace.code_refs, adapter projections and filesystem scan heuristics.
  L2 graph inside a block is capped (~15 visible nodes) and filtered by selected block scope; work.depends_on edges hidden by default unless operator enables task overlay filter.
  Membership heuristics: work item -> block by id/department/target_files; container -> block by path prefix; cross-block links shown as external dashed edges on L2 focus only.
Цель:
  Оператор видит состав блока и локальную схему проектирования без потери readable layout.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: architecture-l2-l3-model-v1
  protocol.id: architecture-graph-model-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Architecture_Edge_Types<[
Базис:
  Architecture edges explain design relations; depends_on remains operational Work Graph semantics only.
Вектор:
  feeds: canonical formats/rules supply downstream runtime or projections; example step-canon -> work-graph.
  uses: runtime consumes another block capability; example work-graph -> agent-runtime.
  validates: verification/trace checks artifacts or transitions; example trace-evidence -> work-graph.
  implements: task/container/code realizes a design artifact; scoped to block detail and trace links.
  defines: protocol/design atom specifies runtime or UI behavior.
  maps_to: domain adapter maps external artifacts to Work Graph/step atoms; example domain-onebase -> work-graph.
  relates_file: memory/evidence/trace node links to file path; used on L2/L3, not on default L1 map.
  Non-architecture edge depends_on: WorkItem queue only; rendered exclusively in Зависимости задач view.
Цель:
  Edge labels remain typed, rebuildable and filterable without turning task queue into architecture canon.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: architecture-edge-types-v1
  protocol.id: architecture-graph-model-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>

#UX_Drill_Down_Pattern<[
Базис:
  Operator needs architecture comprehension without manual graph editing or React Flow-like canvas authoring.
Вектор:
  Sidebar views: Доска, Бэклог, Архитектура (L1 map), Зависимости задач (work deps DAG), Memory later.
  L1 map: read-only block cards + inter-block edges + task count badges; click block -> focus + open block detail panel.
  Block detail panel tabs: Схема (L2 graph or stub), Задачи, Артефакты, Файлы, Memory (stub until Memory v1 export exists).
  Breadcrumb: Проект -> {block title}; back action restores full L1 map; cross-block link opens neighbor block in focus mode.
  Renderer MVP: zero-dependency SVG/HTML inside current UI server; later optional Cytoscape.js + Dagre for larger L2 graphs.
Цель:
  Architecture comprehension and task operations stay in separate but linked views sharing task detail drawer where appropriate.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: architecture-drill-down-ux-v1
  protocol.id: architecture-graph-model-v1
  trace.status: verified
]>
